wn6","name":"Bone Splinter","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["range-increment-60"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"ncqxbnfh64fnf2s374l1":{"damage":"2d6+13","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":19},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"OBZmEr6a4j0TfEsh","name":"Eat Marrow","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round;</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The skeletal monstrosity has a creature grabbed in its jaws;</p>\n\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The skeletal monstrosity chews on the grabbed creature and sups its leaking marrow, dealing [[/r (3d12 + 11)[bludgeoning]]] damage (@Check[type:fortitude|dc:29|name:Eat Marrow DC|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{basic Fortitude} save). The skeletal monstrosity regains Hit Points equal to the damage dealt.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"WMVavVz1bOs6YODP","name":"Screech","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The skeletal monstrosity unleashes a bloodcurdling roar that can be heard up to 1 mile away. Creatures within 500 feet that hear the roar must succeed at a @Check[type:will|dc:28|name:Screech DC|traits:auditory, divine, enchantment, fear, mental|showDC:gm]{Will} save or be @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}. On a critical failure, the creature is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3} and is also @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds} or until it's no longer frightened, whichever comes first.</p>\n<p>Regardless of their save, creatures are immune to the skeletal monstrosity's Screech for 24 hours.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","divine","fear","mental"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"4cqxqTCMwuo8Tfck","name":"Splinter Burst","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The skeletal monstrosity exhales a spray of sharp bones, dealing [[/r 7d10[slashing]]] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:15] (@Check[type:reflex|dc:28|name:Splinter Burst DC|traits:damaging-effect, divine, evocation|showDC:gm]{basic Reflex} save).</p>\n<p>The skeletal monstrosity can't use Splinter Burst again for [[/br 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"1hiD2N3ntJrmVjIs","name":"Sweeping Slash","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The skeletal monstrosity Strides and makes two wing scythe Strikes, each at any point during its Stride. Its multiple attack penalty does not increase until after it makes both attacks.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":2},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"oXwKMzJ4yGwbseuS","name":"Trample","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/ThreeActions.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Large or smaller, Foot, @Check[type:reflex|dc:29|name:|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:gm]{basic reflex} save</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Trample]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"trample","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":3},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.UNah0bxXxkcZjxO3","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"pWh5HACViWWujSaP","name":"Negative Healing","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"pf2e":{"lootable":false},"core":{}},"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":160,"temp":0,"max":160,"details":"negative healing"},"ac":{"value":29,"details":"","base":29},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"immunities":[{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"mental"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"type":"cold","value":10},{"type":"electricity","value":10},{"type":"fire","value":10},{"type":"piercing","value":10},{"type":"slashing","value":10}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":[],"details":""},"level":{"value":10},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Rumor has it the first skeletal monstrosity was a red dragon who was interrupted during her ritual to become a ravener. The resulting calamity left the once- dragon weak and monstrous, a mockery of her former might and a far cry from her aspirations as an undead tyrant. She was grounded in her new, terrible form, stripped of her intellect and magic, and cursed to walk the world until merciful destruction released her soul once and for all.</p>\n<p>While there is plenty of truth to this tale, necromancers, evil clerics, and other harbingers of undeath more often create their own versions of these brutish horrors. Because collecting the bones of a dragon is impractical (to say the least), such crafters typically scrape together the bones of multiple smaller creatures, then glue them together with resin or magic before animating the monstrosity. Tyrannosauruses and other large dinosaurs are popular bases to work from. The crafter can then take the bones of smaller animals, sharpen them, and fasten them around the dinosaur skeleton to create jagged spines, extra tails, bladed elbows, or \"wing scythes.\"</p>\n<h2>Bone Spitters</h2>\n<p>Skeletal monstrosities can fling their very bones at foes, either sending a single large rib slicing through the air or exhaling a violent blast of fine bone shards. Because they are able to consume other creatures' bones and incorporate them into their own bodies, skeletal monstrosities never lack ammunition.</p>\n<h2>Monster Part Subsystem</h2>\n<p><strong>Skeletal Monstrosity Creature 10 </strong></p>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 125/275/500 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning, piercing, slashing), armor (heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Athletics, Intimidation)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> dexterity, energy resistant (cold, electricity, fire, negative), evil, mental, negative, sensory (darkvision), strength, sturdy, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary","authors":"K.M. Kovalcik","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":3},"con":{"mod":0},"int":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":0},"cha":{"mod":0}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":17,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":23},"intimidation":{"base":18}},"traits":{"value":["evil","mindless","skeleton","undead","unholy"],"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"grg"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"prototypeToken":{"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkTo